# Text files are stored with LF in the repository, whatever the checkout does.
#
# Without this, an edit made through a tool that opens files in text mode on Windows
# silently rewrites every line ending, and a three-line change arrives as a
# whole-file diff. That is not cosmetic: the reviewer verifying a batch by reading
# its diff loses the ability to see what actually changed.
#
# `voice_bridge/mailbox.py` makes the same call in code, for the same reason - the
# mailbox is a shared append-only protocol file, so its bytes must not depend on
# which OS appended the last line.
* text=auto eol=lf
